{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1441001-v5-upcoming-projects","id":1441001,"title":"[V5] Upcoming Projects","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-03-22T17:56:30-07:00","id":1441001,"title":"[V5] Upcoming Projects","content":"I thought we'd have a thread to discuss the various upcoming projects and products that we have to look forward to from White Wolf.<br /> <br /> <u>Onyx Path</u><br /> <br /> * <b>Forbidden Religions</b>: The extended material for Cults of the Blood Gods' blood cults with a whole bunch of new ones ranging from Golconda cults to the Infermal. I'm very impressed with the writers.<br /> <br /> <u>White Wolf</u><br /> <br /> * <b>The Sabbat</b>: Don't know much about this one other than it has been very hotly anticipated and is being written by Justin Achilli. It will also contain information on the Paths of Enlightenment.<br /> <br /> * <b>Second Inquisition</b>: We know even less about this but I am hoping for big things from this one. Fingers crossed for an update of William Shepard.<br /> <br /> * <b>Book of Nod:</b> Hardback reprint.<br /> <br /> <u>Comic Books</u><br /> <br /> * <b>Winter's Teeth</b>: The comic has been renewed as an ongoing due to high sales for the first 5 issues. Hopefully, it will continue on for a long time yet.<br /> <br /> UPDATED 9/22/2021: Finished with issue #10<br /> <br /> * <b>Crimson Thaw: </b>A continuation of Winter's Teeth lasting for three issues.<br /> <br /> UPDATED 9/22/2021: Issue #1 now available<br /> <br /> <u>Audiobooks</u><br /> <br /> * <b>Walk Among Us</b>: Being released on May 5th in non-audiobook format.<br /> <br /> UPDATED: Now available<br /> <br /> * <b>Novels</b>: The Clan Novels, Dark Age Clan Novels, and Grail Covenant will remain with Crossroad Press for the time being.<br /> <br /> <u>Video Games</u><br /> <br /> * <b>Bloodlines 2</b>: We don't know what the situation is there but hopefully the new developers will try to finish what was already done.<br /> <br /> UPDATED: Indefinitely delayed<br /> <br /> * <b>Swangsong</b>: A Telltale-like adventure game where you are three vampires involved in a plot to take over the city of Boston just after it merges its domain with a number of surrounding territories.<br /> <br /> * <b>Out for Blood</b>: A Choice of Games sequel to Night Road, except you're one of the Second Inquisition on a mission to slay as many vampires as possible...or become one.<br /> <br /> UPDATED: Now available on Steam<br /> <br /> * <b>Coteries of New York/Shadows of New York</b>: They just released the soundtrack on vinyl. They've also got plans to release this on physical disc in stores.<br /> <br /> UPDATED: Now available in physical format.<br /> <br /> * <b>Parliament of Knives</b>: A Choice of Games political game of high stakes and Camarilla fru-fruness.<br /> <br /> * <b>Bloodhunt: </b>A battle royal game coming soon to a PC and console near you.<br /> <br /> <u>Board Games</u><br /> <br /> * <b>Chapters</b>: They just received a bunch more pledges to continue development and are apparently continuing on with development.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp