title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-26T19:20:16-07:00","id":1446019,"title":"","content":"I do find myself a little baffled by how easily the Toreador Prince was taken out. A Toreador Elder with, presumably, Auspex and Celerity, and she dies to same sort of assassination attempt that a Brujah neonate later survives almost casually?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-26T19:25:53-07:00","id":1446020,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CajunKhan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1441001-v5-upcoming-projects?p=1446019#post1446019\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I do find myself a little baffled by how easily the Toreador Prince was taken out. A Toreador Elder with, presumably, Auspex and Celerity, and she dies to same sort of assassination attempt that a Brujah neonate later survives almost casually?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think the implication was she was enamoured by her art when the sneak attack happened. Which is the OLD WEAKNESS! Bad Tim Seeley! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/image