ding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-12T12:44:06-07:00","id":1448351,"title":"","content":"Can we add VTES related products to this list? 5th edition was released last year and their kickstarter just went live this week.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Hecata are a sect not a clan.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24211-frontline989","name":"Frontline989","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24211_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-25T17:54:35-07:00","id":1457666,"title":"","content":"From the WoD Twitch from the other day:<br /> <br /> Interview with Renegade, books and tabletop material updates:<ul><li>Elisa talked about the shipping issues due to the pandemic and basically all the same stuff we had all heard or experienced ourselves with it.</li> <li>Sabbat delayed to September (date to be determined). Will be available digitally on both Renegade's site and DTRPG when released.</li> <li>Second Inquisition delay til first of next year.</li> <li>Advised that they are almost done getting their international orders through their site set up, talked some about things being in stores (easier to get all this in the VoD)</li> <li>They showed a copy of their print of the Book of Nod, confirmed it's just a reprint of the old one, confirmed they were holding back a portion of the deluxe/artifact edition for the international orders once they is sorted. Didn't mention a delay that I can recall hearing.</li> <li>New dice with darker red with black ankhs are in the works, proofs and such have been done and approved, no release date yet (talked about causing hell for the factory for various samples and colors, showed briefly some of the other color samples they got)</li> <li>ST kit and screen are on the way and seem to be on time, as no delay was mentioned.</li> <li>Core book PDFs are having bookmarks added back in (they were lost in the conversion, and got missed). PDFs are also being further updated to fix the missed BP descriptions per Jason C.</li> <li>Fall of London is getting some errata in physical print (no word on what errata though).</li> <li>More stuff planned for Vampire for next year, no teasers as to what.</li> </ul>For the rest of it or more detail, check the WoD Twitch or YouTubes.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1808-elmerg","name":"elmerg","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"539"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-21T22:25:30-07:00","id":1460789,"title":"","content":"The final issue of WINTER'S TEETH and first issue of CRIMSON THAW came out today.","signature":"<